#!/bin/bash
clear
rojo="\033[1;31m"
verde="\033[1;32m"
amarillo="\033[1;33m"
blanco="\033[1;37m"
fin="\033[0m"
HOSTS_FILE="/etc/hosts"

echo -e "${rojo}═══════════════════════════════════════${fin}"
echo -e "${blanco}  GESTION DE DNS - @Netxxus${fin}"
echo -e "${rojo}═══════════════════════════════════════${fin}"
echo ""

echo -e "${amarillo}  [1]${fin} Ver registros DNS locales"
echo -e "${amarillo}  [2]${fin} Agregar registro DNS"
echo -e "${amarillo}  [3]${fin} Eliminar registro DNS"
echo -e "${amarillo}  [4]${fin} Test de DNS"
echo -e "${amarillo}  [5]${fin} Cambiar DNS del servidor"
echo -e "${amarillo}  [0]${fin} Volver"
echo ""
echo -ne "${blanco}  Opcion: ${fin}"; read op

case "$op" in
    1)
        clear
        echo -e "${amarillo}  REGISTROS DNS EN /etc/hosts:${fin}"
        echo -e "${rojo}─────────────────────────────────────────${fin}"
        grep -v "^#" "$HOSTS_FILE" | grep -v "^$" | while read line; do
            echo -e "  ${blanco}$line${fin}"
        done
        ;;
    2)
        echo -e "${amarillo}  IP:${fin} "; read ip
        echo -e "${amarillo}  DOMINIO:${fin} "; read dominio
        [[ -z "$ip" || -z "$dominio" ]] && { echo -e "${rojo}  Datos incompletos!${fin}"; sleep 2; exit 1; }
        
        echo "$ip $dominio" >> "$HOSTS_FILE"
        echo -e "${verde}  Registro agregado: $ip $dominio${fin}"
        ;;
    3)
        echo -e "${amarillo}  REGISTROS ACTUALES:${fin}"
        grep -v "^#" "$HOSTS_FILE" | grep -v "^$" | nl
        echo ""
        echo -ne "${rojo}  Numero a ELIMINAR (0=volver): ${fin}"; read num
        [[ "$num" == "0" ]] && exit 0
        
        total=$(grep -cv "^#\|^$" "$HOSTS_FILE")
        if [[ "$num" -ge 1 && "$num" -le "$total" ]]; then
            registro=$(grep -v "^#\|^$" "$HOSTS_FILE" | sed -n "${num}p")
            sed -i "/^$(echo $registro | awk '{print $1}') ${registro#* }/d" "$HOSTS_FILE"
            echo -e "${verde}  Registro eliminado: $registro${fin}"
        else
            echo -e "${rojo}  Numero invalido!${fin}"
        fi
        ;;
    4)
        echo -e "${amarillo}  DOMINIO A TESTEAR:${fin} "; read dominio
        [[ -z "$dominio" ]] && exit 1
        
        echo -e "${amarillo}  Resolviendo $dominio...${fin}"
        ping -c 3 "$dominio" 2>/dev/null
        ;;
    5)
        echo -e "${amarillo}  DNS ACTUAL:${fin}"
        cat /etc/resolv.conf | grep nameserver
        echo ""
        echo -e "${amarillo}  NUEVO DNS PRIMARIO:${fin} "; read dns1
        echo -e "${amarillo}  NUEVO DNS SECUNDARIO:${fin} "; read dns2
        
        if [[ -n "$dns1" ]]; then
            cp /etc/resolv.conf /etc/resolv.conf.bak
            echo "nameserver $dns1" > /etc/resolv.conf
            [[ -n "$dns2" ]] && echo "nameserver $dns2" >> /etc/resolv.conf
            echo -e "${verde}  DNS actualizado!${fin}"
        fi
        ;;
    0)
        exit 0
        ;;
esac

echo ""
echo -e "${blanco}  [ENTER] Volver${fin}"
read
